+/** \file  ee_oo_api_osek.c
+ *  \brief  OSEK Kernel APIs Implementation.
+ *
+ *  This files contains the implementation of all OSEK Kernel APIs in
+ *  Erika Enterprise.
+ *
+ *  \note  TO BE DOCUMENTED!!!
+ *
+ *  \author  Errico Guidieri
+ *  \date  2016
